Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:15.68,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}One Dream One Wish{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}One Dream One Wish{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:20.60,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}kanaetai nara Over The Top{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If you want to make it \Ncome true, Over The Top{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.73,0:00:28.27,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,ONE PIECE - LAND OF WANO ARC
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.53,0:00:40.16,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}mitakoto mo nai sekai mezashi{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.53,0:00:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Setting out into the unknown world{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:45.33,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}araburu namikaze koete{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Weathering rough wind and waves{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.37,0:00:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I have to keep going because \NI want to get there first{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.37,0:00:50.04,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}tsukisusumanakya dame sa \Nichibannori shitain da{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.09,0:00:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Worry later since it's \Nall sink or swim anyway{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.09,0:00:56.30,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}shinpai toka atomawashi \Ndouse shoubu ichika bachika{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.43,0:01:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}When your opponent looks daunting{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.43,0:01:02.85,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}aite ga dekaku mietara{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.89,0:01:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's a sign that your heart is shrinking{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.89,0:01:07.94,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}kokoro ga chijinderu shouko{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Running away is not a choice{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:10.48,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}nigeru nante choisu wa nai{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.52,0:01:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Take one step closer{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.52,0:01:12.61,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}ippo soba e chikadukun da{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.65,0:01:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Being called insolent's a compliment, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.65,0:01:15.11,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}namaiki tte homekotoba?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.11,0:01:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}When things become tough, \Nthat's when you should laugh{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.11,0:01:19.45,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}kitsui toki hodo warattoke{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.99,0:01:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If you want to look for a new tomorrow{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.99,0:01:25.41,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}atarashii ashita sagashi ni ikitai no nara{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.45,0:01:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Polish your unique confidence{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.45,0:01:30.67,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}tobikkiri no jishin wo migaite{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Until your footsteps{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:35.21,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}tabi wo shita ashiato ga{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Yes! Become a map{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:38.88,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}sou! chizu ni kawaru made{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.93,0:01:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}A new horizon, look, how far you've come{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.93,0:01:43.43,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}atarashii Horizon hora susunde kita bun{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.47,0:01:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's brighter and the \Nlevel of difficulty rises{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.47,0:01:48.48,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}mabushisa to nanido ga joushou{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.85,0:01:53.19,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}yumeutsutsu de okose Hurricane{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.85,0:01:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Live in your dream and raise a hurricane{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:58.03,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}saa! chaato kakimidase{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Now! Stir up the rankings{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.07,0:02:02.32,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}One Dream One Wish{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.07,0:02:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}One Dream One Wish{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:06.83,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}yume wa nigenai... zenbu Knock out{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dreams don't run away... Knock everything out{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:09.21,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Over The Top{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Over The Top{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.60,0:02:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's next?!\NThey're not even a good enough warm up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You stole my sword, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It is not your sword...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.53,0:02:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you a weapon collector?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.95,0:02:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you gonna do with all those?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.71,0:02:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We happen to need a lot of weapons, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.13,0:03:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your weapon collection...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.05,0:03:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna take the whole thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.89,0:03:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will bring you down instead,\Nyou damn mountain bandit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry if I confused you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.74,0:03:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.95,0:03:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"Gyukimaru!\NZoro Fights a Duel on Bandit's Bridge!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.47,0:03:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna eat the red-bean soup already...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.89,0:03:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, haven't we reached\Nthe place called Udon yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chopperemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.69,0:03:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.31,0:03:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't look at me drooling like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.69,0:04:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It won't be long, Olin-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.15,0:04:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Once we get to Udon, \Nwe'll save Big Bro Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.74,0:04:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...we'll eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...the red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Otama-{\i1}chan{\i0}, do you like it, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.09,0:04:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was treated to it by Otsuru-{\i1}san{\i0}\Non my birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.05,0:04:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My mouth slowly filled with\Nthe sweetness of the red-bean paste...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.35,0:04:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My taste buds were truly dancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.90,0:04:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean paste is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Yes! Absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh! Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean paste! And a rice cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.66,0:04:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've never had such a soft and delicious thing\Nin my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.63,0:05:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A white rice cake shines\Nlike a living frog's eyeball!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A frog's eyeball?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.30,0:05:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Olin-{\i1}chan{\i0}, that's a little freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah? Just by thinking about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't help drooling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not edible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.15,0:05:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't wait to have the red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.03,0:05:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They are getting quite excited\Ntalking about the red-bean soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.37,0:05:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:41.20,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Once she finds out there's no red-bean soup,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:43.30,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,the shock might bring back her memories,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}and she'll return to herself!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.47,0:05:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.51,0:05:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Instead of saving him,\Nwe'll put Luffy in harm's way!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What should I do?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:06:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What should I do?!\NWhat am I supposed to do?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Bring me more red-bean soup!\N--Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luffytaro wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You did it, Luffytaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.41,0:07:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gee... You took down all the Pleasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's not it? You won again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.34,0:07:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, Rayleigh was doing it effortlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.93,0:07:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rayleigh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.97,0:07:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Luffy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.19,0:07:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}When you use the Haki of the Color of Arms,\Nimagine you're wearing invisible armor.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.61,0:07:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At that moment, Rayleigh sent the elephant flying\Nwithout touching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The first Haki he showed me was\Na very high level one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I can use that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.75,0:07:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.72,0:07:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Grizzly...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Magnum!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can take down Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's taking too much time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you let me do it,\Nthe execution will be done in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't really understand\Nhow the Sumo Inferno works!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.37,0:08:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The length of the fight
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and the number of opponents.\NThose are the toughest elements in fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll lose his spirit and energy little by little\Nand die miserably.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"The execution will be done in no time"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.35,0:08:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.18,0:08:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not exciting at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want a refill!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.73,0:08:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Again?! You've already had\Nso much red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.28,0:08:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Screw you!\NRed-bean soup is like oxygen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:08:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.32,0:09:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No one else can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My red-bean soup! It's my favorite!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.71,0:09:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Send my opponent flying\Nas if I'm wearing invisible armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.97,0:09:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Straw hat man, what are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.39,0:09:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna practice! Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your next opponents are...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...the Gifters!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.16,0:09:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't miss any secret talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bat Smile Fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bat-man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.83,0:09:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The beautiful leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a swift runner!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.05,0:09:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gazelle Smile Fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gazelle-man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.34,0:10:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're the Gifters!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no! There are two Gifters!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They kidnapped Tama, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.23,0:10:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you mess with Holdem-{\i1}sama{\i0}\Nand Bakura Town!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.32,0:10:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't get away with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Great! They're perfect sparring partners!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.91,0:10:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lock eyes with your opponents!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.65,0:10:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Beautiful Leg Spin Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was just an ordinary punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do it right this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.83,0:11:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That wasn't it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Luffy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's invisible armor.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.58,0:11:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Invisible...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.63,0:11:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The winner is Luffytaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This Straw Hat is quite strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmmm... That wasn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not supposed to touch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I could try something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.69,0:12:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, well!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.11,0:13:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.19,0:13:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.57,0:13:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.92,0:13:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I met Ryuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't lie to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You met Ryuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:48.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How could I believe such nonsense?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, the soul belonged to\Nsomeone else I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.08,0:13:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop talking gibberish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How could you know Ryuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.21,0:14:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ryuma is a great swordsman\Nwho was said to cut any opponent in an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.80,0:14:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You do not know how valuable\Nthe great sword Shusui is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.97,0:14:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shusui is the Land of Wano's treasure!\NIt belongs to Ryuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.77,0:14:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A long time ago, when the Land of Wano
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,was recognized as the Land \Nof Gold by other countries...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.57,0:14:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gold? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unguarded!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pirates around the world wanted gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nobles tried to rule\Nthe Land of Gold - the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He showed those enemies from overseas\Nhow formidable he was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:15:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and burned the Land of Wano's samurai\Nin their minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That is who Ryuma is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There are so many legends related to him\Nas a swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.95,0:15:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.20,0:15:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...says that he slayed a dragon\Nthat appeared above the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After his death, he was laid to rest in a temple\Nwith the great sword Shusui...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.17,0:15:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...as this country's God of the Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shusui is a national treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it has nothing to do with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:16:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take back Shusui!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't feel comfortable \Nwith just two swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think I have overestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shusui is a Black Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.51,0:16:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, it was forged\Nthrough the battles that Ryuma fought!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was only trying to figure \Nout if you were a punk
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.44,0:16:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,with no backbone who just wanted to have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.27,0:16:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Forged"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.65,0:16:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah, I was wondering about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Don't tell me that Black Blades are...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.80,0:16:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.35,0:17:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unguarded!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't try your best to catch me off guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.57,0:17:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Catching people off guard is the only way to\Nwin deadly battles, so that is all I am trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Somebody, help!\NSomeone is trying to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, there's a samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.25,0:17:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are they serious or just fooling around?\NI can't tell!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.59,0:17:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Swordsmen, please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.77,0:17:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess they're not joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.10,0:18:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unguarded!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.65,0:18:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you wait?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.82,0:18:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you, take a hint!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Our duel is not over!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.95,0:18:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll fight you! But could you wait?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.35,0:19:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You are the murderer - Zorojuro, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.39,0:19:14.44,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,A WANTED PERSON IN THE FLOWER CAPITAL
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.86,0:19:18.69,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,HITOKIRI KAMAZO
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zorojuro, why would you \Nwanna help that woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do {\i1}you{\i0} wanna slash a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm only trying to kill that brat\Nwho won't stop laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.97,0:19:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, Toko.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.43,0:19:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hitokiri Kamazo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.64,0:19:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a street slasher\Nwho randomly kills people in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you're actually an assassin working for Orochi\Nwhile disguised as an outlaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Otherwise, why would you want to kill Otoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:20:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You address the Shogun, Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0},\Nwith no honorific.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.86,0:20:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are {\i1}you{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Samurai-{\i1}sama{\i0}, please help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.41,0:20:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, of course, I'm not gonna just stand here\Nand watch a kid and a woman get killed...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will give you anything you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Sake{\i0} and food would be nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.43,0:20:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.56,0:20:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right! Deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No problem. I've been told that I can kill\Nas many as I want if they get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:21:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I often get in trouble afterwards\Nwhen I slay someone who has a boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.46,0:21:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.67,0:21:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be the one dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.18,0:21:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}He's quite strong!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now you're getting serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.31,0:23:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Against the two formidable opponents,\NKamazo and Gyukimaru, Zoro wields only two swords!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.02,0:23:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The fierce scramble drives him into a corner!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.24,0:23:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Facing the worst crisis ever without Shusui,\Nhe risks his life and takes the chance of a lifetime!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.29,0:23:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the next episode of One Piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.82,0:23:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"A Big Turnover! The Three-Sword \NStyle Overcomes Danger!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.97,0:23:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:46.42,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,
